{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Esther did not tell her birthplace.</b> To the king, and not to the eunuchs whom he stationed before her." "<b>As a trusted one</b> is from the same root as when one takes an אומן, and it is a noun, like חכמה itself."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:47.986297752Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}